* To enforce structural safety and manage enterprise liability under Product Liability (PL) legislation, all internal mechanism and battery cartridge swaps must be executed directly at certified physical salons by accredited technicians.
* For the Entry Plan (Annual Maintenance), the enterprise legally discloses at the time of contract that depending on daily usage, wear on sensors or motors may lead to malfunctions before the next scheduled annual check-up, securing written informed consent.

## 5-2. Retention Incentives Linked with Sensory Calibration

* Enrolling in the Premium Subscription (Quarterly Maintenance) grants milestone benefits after one year of consecutive compliance, including a fee waiver for the next basic service window and a local soft-ware flashing session to upload advanced behavioral motions (e.g., complex ear expressions, rare vocalizations, extended chaotic affection routines).
* Simultaneously, during quarterly visits, technicians isolate the chemical sensor inside a controlled, constant temperature and humidity testing enclosure. This executes a periodic calibration routine to negate household environmental drift, ensuring perfect sensory reliability.

